    <section id="stage-publish" class="journey-stage" data-stage-panel="publish" hidden>
      <header class="stage-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Stage 3 &middot; Publish &amp; Play</span><h2>Send this iteration to Runtime, then follow the live trail</h2><p>Publishing creates immutable questpack bytes. The cockpit names the next action on OMEN.</p></div></header>
      <section class="runtime-panel compact-cockpit panel">
        <div class="publish-command"><div><span class="eyebrow">Quest readiness</span><h2 id="publish-ready-title">Choose a quest</h2><p id="publish-ready-detail" class="muted">A saved draft can be checked and published.</p></div><div class="readiness-summary" aria-label="Readiness"><span>Draft <strong id="draft-readiness">Waiting</strong></span><span>Rehearsal <strong id="preview-readiness">Optional</strong></span><span>Runtime <strong id="runtime-readiness">Checking</strong></span></div><div class="publish-actions"><button id="validate-project" class="quiet">Check quest</button><button id="publish-project">Publish this iteration</button></div></div>
        <div class="cockpit-body"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">OMEN live trail</span><h2>Runtime cockpit</h2></div><span id="runtime-phase" class="readiness neutral">Waiting for project</span></div><p id="runtime-next" class="next-step">Publish a quest to begin.</p><ol class="lap"><li data-phase="published"><span>1</span>Publish</li><li data-phase="checked"><span>2</span>F10 Check</li><li data-phase="active"><span>3</span>F11 Load</li><li data-phase="bound"><span>4</span>Bind</li><li data-phase="complete"><span>5</span>Play event</li></ol><details id="runtime-receipt-details" class="receipt-details"><summary><span>Live receipts</span><small id="receipt-count">None yet &middot; refreshes automatically</small></summary><div id="runtime-receipts" class="receipt-list"><div class="empty">No matching live receipts yet.</div></div></details><p class="immutability-note">Published versions stay immutable. Start a new iteration before changing one.</p></div>
